recordings, public domain) and SIWIS, and are measured not to resemble any
reader. Every output carries the AudioSeal AI watermark: do not remove it.
Only use your own voice, or a voice whose owner has given you written consent.
Imitating a person's voice without their consent may infringe their rights
(French Civil Code, art. 9). Distributing such content without it being
obvious, or expressly stated, that it was generated by an algorithm may also
be a criminal offence (French Criminal Code, art. 226-8).
